   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb xml:id="pb-1r-trl" facs="berkeley:recid:85259-43C.recto_ii.jpg/full/full/0/default.jpg"/>
            <ab xml:id="MP0046_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/><gap extent="several words" reason="smudge"/>
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/><gap extent="several words" reason="smudge"/> (PWN) YDH Y hmʾy plhwṭl ʾwsṭʾndʾl (lʾsṭ?)
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/><gap extent="several words" reason="smudge"/> <supplied resp="#DW">w</supplied>ndʾṭbwlcmṭrʾp̄ʾṭ
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>dʾlyk [ẔNH] BYRḤ šṭrywr Y ŠNṬ
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/>[$]$-IIII-IIII ʾMṬ yẕdʾnpʾnk' ʾwsṭʾndʾl
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p1-l6"/><gap extent="several words" reason="smudge"/> MN hʾnk'
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trl-p1-l7"/>ʿL dsṭ[kr]ṭ' MNW grmk' K-#III (III)
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trl-p1-l8"/>ʾwsṭʾndʾl G-I K-#IIII W (PWN ẔNH)
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trl-p1-l9"/>ʾDYN' (pʾ)ṭglʾḇ-I (ḤṬ)YMWNṭ W BRʾ
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trl-p1-l10"/>ẔNH swṭ' P(WN) kʾl zʾdsṭn' Lʾ
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trl-p1-l11"/>ʾp̄ʾsṭ['] W ẔNH p(ʾ)ṭglʾḇ mṭrpnʾh
               <lb n="12" xml:id="trl-p1-l12"/>(P)WN gwkʾdymwdlyh(ʾ Y) zʾṭʾnplhw Y
               <lb n="13" xml:id="trl-p1-l13"/>...-dʾn (ḤṬYMWNṭ)
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP0046_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/><gap extent="several words" reason="smudge"/>
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/><gap extent="several words" reason="smudge"/> (pad) dast ī hamē farroxtar ōstāndār (rāst?)
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/><gap extent="several words" reason="smudge"/> <supplied resp="#DW">W</supplied>indādburzmihr-ābād
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>dārīg (ēn) māh Šahrewar ī sāl
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/>(48) ka yazdānbānag ōstāndār
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trc-p1-l6"/><gap extent="several words" reason="smudge"/> az xānag
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trc-p1-l7"/>ō dast[gir]d kē garmak k(abīz) (6)
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trc-p1-l8"/>ōstāndār g(rīw) 1 k(abīz) 4 ud (pad ēn)
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trc-p1-l9"/>ēg pādīrāy-ēw āwišt ud be
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trc-p1-l10"/>ēn sūd pad kār zāyistan nē
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trc-p1-l11"/>abāyist ud ēn pādīrāy Mihrpanāh
               <lb n="12" xml:id="trc-p1-l12"/>pad gugāy-muhrīhā ī Zādanfarrox ī
               <lb n="13" xml:id="trc-p1-l13"/><gap extent="several words" reason="smudge"/> (āwišt)
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP0046_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/><gap extent="several words" reason="smudge"/>
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p1-l2"/><gap extent="several words" reason="smudge"/> on trust of the always very fortunate Ōstāndār truly (?)
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p1-l3"/><gap extent="several words" reason="smudge"/> <supplied resp="#DW">W</supplied>indādburzmihr-ābād
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trans-p1-l4"/>manager [this] month Šahrewar of the year
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trans-p1-l5"/>48 when the Ōstāndār, standing under the protection of the gods,
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trans-p1-l6"/><gap extent="several words" reason="smudge"/> from the "House"
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trans-p1-l7"/>to the Estate (for) which 6 kabīz of garmak,
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trans-p1-l8"/>(for the) Ōstāndār 1 grīw 4 kabīz and over this
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trans-p1-l9"/>then (only) one receipt he sealed and apart
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trans-p1-l10"/>(from) this profit for the transction it was not necessary to demand (another one)
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trans-p1-l11"/>and this receipt Mihrpanāh
               <lb n="12" xml:id="trans-p1-l12"/>with the witnesses' seals of Zādanfarrox
               <lb n="13" xml:id="trans-p1-l13"/><gap extent="several words" reason="smudge"/> (sealed).
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>